# astrion-skill v1
goal: Toggle Wi-Fi on or off
trigger:
  - phrase: "wifi off"
  - phrase: "wifi on"
  - phrase: "toggle wifi"
do: |
  Toggle the Wi-Fi radio state. Emit 'network:wifi-toggled' on the
  event bus so the menubar status icon updates. Show a notification
  with the new state and (if connecting) the SSID once associated.
  If turning off and a download is in progress, ask the user to confirm
  via rapid-confirm before proceeding. Note: this requires the system
  bridge (only available on Linux desktop install, not in browser).
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 150
  reversibility: BOUNDED
